  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Portfolio Page**\n\nI\'m focusing on crafting a modern and responsive portfolio webpage for a data analytics profile. It\'s crucial to ensure a professional look and feel. I\'m considering both UX/UI principles and frontend development to deliver a standout portfolio. The goal is to provide a seamless user experience.\n\n\n**Defining the Visual Style**\n\nI\'ve been solidifying the visual style for the portfolio. I\'m leaning toward a clean, minimalist layout with plenty of whitespace. I envision using a professional background (#F7F5F2) and white cards (#FFFFFF). For text, I\'m thinking #2D3748, with petroleum blue (#1F4E5F) as the primary color and soft green (#5B7C6D) as a secondary accent. I\'m focusing on modern typography and subtle design elements to give the site a corporate premium look.\n\n\n**Adding Portfolio Content**\n\nI\'m now integrating the core content: education (courses, certifications), a contact form with links to LinkedIn, GitHub, and email. I\'m also planning for optional dark mode, accessibility features, and scroll animations, aiming for clean, scalable code. I\'m exploring the `image-generation` tool, potentially using it for SVG placeholder visualizations or mockups for the project showcases. I\'ll focus on beautiful Tailwind layouts.\n\n\n**Reviewing the Project Structure**\n\nI\'m now diving into the codebase. It\'s a React workspace using Vite, Tailwind v4, and `motion` for animations. I\'m focusing on the `package.json` to understand dependencies and the project structure, before checking `metadata.json`. It\'s a Vite + React SPA, aligning with the active template, so I\'ll design this for the client.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will examine `package.json` and `metadata.json` to understand the setup of our React application in detail. This ensures that I use the precise styles and build scripts that cooperate with the development server."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 743309131
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
