/span></div><div class=\\\"flex gap-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#2D3748]/60\\\"><a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"text-[#1F4E5F] border-b-2 border-[#1F4E5F]\\\">Overview</a><a href=\\\"#\\\">Experience</a><a href=\\\"#\\\">Projects</a><a href=\\\"#\\\">Contact</a></div></nav><main class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col px-10 pt-8 pb-4 gap-6\\\"><section class=\\\"flex gap-6 h-[260px]\\\"><div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center\\\"><h1 class=\\\"text-[84px] leading-[0.85] font-black tracking-tighter uppercase mb-2\\\">Javier<br/><span class=\\\"text-[#1F4E5F]\\\">Analytics</span></h1><p class=\\\"text-lg font-medium text-[#5B7C6D] max-w-md mt-2\\\">Data Analyst | Business Intelligence Expert | Python Developer</p><p class=\\\"text-sm text-[#2D3748]/70 mt-4 max-w-sm leading-relaxed\\\">Transforming complex data into actionable business strategies through advanced modeling and clear storytelling.</p><div class=\\\"flex gap-4 mt-6\\\"><button class=\\\"bg-[#1F4E5F] text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-bold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-[#1F4E5F]/20 hover:scale-105 transition-transform\\\">Download CV</button><button class=\\\"border-2 border-[#1F4E5F] text-[#1F4E5F] px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-bold text-sm\\\">Contact Me</button></div></div><div class=\\\"w-[380px] bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.03] border border-white flex flex-col justify-between\\\"><div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\"><h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#2D3748]/40\\\">Core Skill Matrix</h3><span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono bg-[#5B7C6D]/10 text-[#5B7C6D] px-2 py-1 rounded\\\">UPDATE: 2024.11</span></div><div class=\\\"space-y-4 my-4\\\"><div class=\\\"space-y-1\\\"><div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-xs font-bold\\\"><span>SQL & Python</span><span>95%</span></div><div class=\\\"h-1.5 bg-[#F7F5F2] rounded-full overflow-hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"h-full bg-[#1F4E5F] w-[95%]\\\"></div></div></div><div class=\\