\\\"><div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\"><div class=\\\"w-full h-32 bg-[#1F4E5F]/5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border border-dashed border-[#1F4E5F]/20\\\"><div class=\\\"text-[#1F4E5F]/40 flex flex-col items-center\\\"><span class=\\\"text-3xl\\\">\360\237\222\260</span><span class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-tighter mt-1\\\">Lead_Score.sql</span></div></div><h4 class=\\\"font-bold text-lg\\\">Propensity Scoring Model</h4><p class=\\\"text-xs text-[#2D3748]/60 line-clamp-2\\\">Algorithmic lead scoring for B2B sales funnel optimization, increasing conversion rates by 18%.</p></div><div class=\\\"pt-4 border-t border-[#F7F5F2] flex items-center justify-between mt-auto\\\"><div class=\\\"flex gap-1\\\"><span class=\\\"text-[9px] bg-[#F7F5F2] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold\\\">SQL</span><span class=\\\"text-[9px] bg-[#F7F5F2] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold\\\">Tableau</span></div><button class=\\\"text-[#1F4E5F] text-xs font-black\\\">DEMO \342\206\222</button></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\\\"h-14 px-10 border-t border-[#1F4E5F]/10 flex items-center justify-between bg-white/20\\\"><div class=\\\"flex gap-6 items-center\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\"><div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\\\"></div><span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Available for new projects</span></div><div class=\\\"w-px h-4 bg-[#1F4E5F]/20\\\"></div><span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono opacity-50\\\">javier.analytics@portfolio.io</span></div><div class=\\\"flex gap-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter\\\"><a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-[#1F4E5F]\\\">LinkedIn</a><a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-[#1F4E5F]\\\">GitHub</a><a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-[#1F4E5F]\\\">Tableau Public</a></div></footer></div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
